('B2', '“…‘God opposes the proud, but gives grace to the humble.’” (James 4:6)'),
('B', '**Faith community (clinical).** Offer accountability relationships and quiet service roles; be cautious about placing narcissistic members in leadership or platforms that feed grandiosity.'),
